        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Gilbert Strang\n- Companies: MathWorks\n- Products: Simulink\n- Places: Massachusetts Institute of Technology, Cutler Park, Needham, Massachusetts, Charles River, Route 128/I-95\n- Roles: MathWorks Professor of Mathematics\n- Topics: mathematical computing software, graphical programming, modeling, simulation, dynamic systems\n\nFacts:\n- Gilbert Strang is the MathWorks Professor of Mathematics at the Massachusetts Institute of Technology.\n- MathWorks is an American privately held corporation that specializes in mathematical computing software.\n- Simulink is a graphical programming environment developed by MathWorks for modeling, simulating, and analyzing multidomain dynamic systems.\n- Cutler Park is a state-owned nature preserve and public recreation area in Needham, Massachusetts, located between Route 128/I-95 and the Charles River.",
